                '### EASY — `duration`\n| model | TIER | E[$/accepted] |\n|---|---|---|\n| alpha | 1,000 | $1.0000 |\n'
                '### INTEGRATION — `orgsync`\n| model | TIER | E[$/accepted] |\n|---|---|---|\n| alpha | 2,500 | $2.0000 |\n')
